  "sections": [
    {
      "id": "K18-01",
      "title": "椭圆与双曲线的焦点三角形",
      "sourcePages": [25],
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "图形($\\triangle PF_1F_2$为曲线的焦点三角形)"
        },
        {
          "type": "figure",
          "assetKey": "k18-p25-ellipse-triangle",
          "width": 750,
          "height": 735,
          "caption": "椭圆"
        },
        {
          "type": "figure",
          "assetKey": "k18-p25-hyperbola-triangle",
          "width": 750,
          "height": 750,
          "caption": "双曲线"
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "columns": ["", "椭圆", "双曲线"],
          "rows": [
            [
              "三条边之间的关系",
              "$|PF_1|+|PF_2|=2a,|F_1F_2|=2c$",
              "$||PF_1|-|PF_2||=2a,|F_1F_2|=2c$"
            ],
            [
              "焦点三角形的周长$L$",
              "定值；$L=2a+2c$",
              "不是定值；$L=r_1+r_2+2c\\in(4c,+\\infty)$"
            ],
            [
              "$r_1\\cdot r_2$",
              "$r_1\\cdot r_2=\\frac{2b^2}{1+\\cos\\theta}=a^2-e^2x_0^2$",
              "$r_1\\cdot r_2=\\frac{2b^2}{1-\\cos\\theta}=e^2x_0^2-a^2$"
            ],
            [
              "焦点三角形的面积$S$",
              "$S=b^2\\cdot\\tan\\frac{\\theta}{2}=c\\cdot|y_0|$，当$P$为短轴端点时，$\\theta$最大，同时$S$取得最大值$bc$",
              "$S=\\frac{b^2}{\\tan\\frac{\\theta}{2}}=c\\cdot|y_0|\\in(0,+\\infty)$，$S$无最值"
            ],
            [
              "离心率",
              "$e=\\frac{2c}{2a}=\\frac{|F_1F_2|}{r_1+r_2}=\\frac{\\sin\\theta}{\\sin\\beta+\\sin\\alpha}=\\frac{\\sin(\\alpha+\\beta)}{\\sin\\beta+\\sin\\alpha}$",
              "$e=\\frac{2c}{2a}=\\frac{|F_1F_2|}{|r_1-r_2|}=\\frac{\\sin\\theta}{|\\sin\\beta-\\sin\\alpha|}=\\frac{\\sin(\\alpha+\\beta)}{|\\sin\\beta-\\sin\\alpha|}$"
            ],
            [
              "$\\triangle PF_1F_2$的内切圆",
              "内切圆半径$r=\\frac{2S}{L}=\\frac{b^2\\cdot\\tan\\frac{\\theta}{2}}{a+c}$",
              "内切圆圆心的横坐标恒为$a$"
            ]
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
